    "body": "I've updated this PR to be on top of #2439, which should make the important changes clearer if you just look at the second commit. I've also updated the tests. There doesn't seem to be a lot of interop around the failing test cases---even when different browsers fail the same test, they often do so in different ways. So I think the plan in this PR is still pretty good.",
